# so this file governs its context. Keep the context to what the image copies.
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/coverage
.git
.github
docs
rtl-hebrew-docs
apps/mobile
apps/api/__tests__
apps/api/scripts
